vibrator_service.vibrate(effect)\n\t\t\t\tlabel.text = \"5\"\n\t\t\telse:\n\t\t\t\tprinterr(\"Vibration is not supported on device\")\n\t\t\t\tlabel_2.text = \"6\"\n\t\telse:\n\t\t\tprinterr(\"Unable to retrieve the vibrator service\")\n\t\t\tlabel_2.text = \"7\"\n\telse:\n\t\tprinterr(\"Couldn't find AndroidRuntime singleton\")\n\t\tlabel_2.text = \"8\"\n```\n\nI don't see the label text to be updated to \"5\", it stops at \"4.2\"\n\nI have added the vibration permission and testing on a real device","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2701103535/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2701480289","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103572#issuecomment-2701480289","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103572","id":2701480289,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hBVFh","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/u